### 47. ★ 修改刚新增的车次：只改备注，车次号不变
### 这条专门验证：
###   ① 用的是 update 不是 insert
###   ② train.setId(id) 有没有漏
###   ③ 查重有没有排除自己
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/admin/trains/{{newTrainId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "trainNo": "D9999",
  "trainType": "D",
  "startStationId": 1,
  "endStationId": 2,
  "remark": "已修改"
}

> {%
    client.test("修改成功", function () {
        client.assert(response.body.code === 200, "期望 200，实际 " + response.body.code + " / " + response.body.msg);
    });
%}


### 48. 再查一次，确认备注真的改了
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/trains/{{newTrainId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

> {%
    client.test("备注已经更新", function () {
        client.assert(response.body.code === 200, "期望 200，实际 " + response.body.code);
        client.assert(response.body.data.remark === "已修改",
            "期望备注是【已修改】，实际是 " + response.body.data.remark);
    });
%}


